{"description": {"type": "/type/text", "value": "The police are baffled In the middle of the night, the residents of a quiet street are awakened by horrfying shrieks from a nearby house. Neighbors and police rush to the scene, but they are too late. A mother and daughter have been murdered, and the police are shocked by what they find inside the home. Who could have committed the murder — and why?\r\n\r\n\"The Murders in the Rue Morgue\" is just one of the heart-pounding stories you'll discover in Famous Tales of Mystery and Horror.\r\n\r\nComplete and Unabridged\r\nA WATERMILL CLASSIC\r\n--back cover"}, "notes": {"type": "/type/text", "value": "Complete and unabridged\r\nUS/CAN"}, "identifiers": {"librarything": ["38333"], "goodreads": ["58860387"]}, "title": "Famous Tales of Mystery and Horror", "authors": [{"key": "/authors/OL28127A"}], "publish_date": "1980", "publishers": ["Watermill Press"], "table_of_contents": [{"level": 0, "label": "The Telltale Heart", "title": "1", "type": {"key": "/type/toc_item"}}, {"level": 0, "label": "The Masque of the Red Death", "title": "10", "type": {"key": "/type/toc_item"}}, {"level": 0, "label": "The Oblong Box", "title": "21", "type": {"key": "/type/toc_item"}}, {"level": 0, "label": "The Murders in the Rue Morgue", "title": "41", "type": {"key": "/type/toc_item"}}, {"level": 0, "label": "The Purloined Letter", "title": "101", "type": {"key": "/type/toc_item"}}, {"level": 0, "label": "About the Author", "title": "133", "type": {"key": "/type/toc_item"}}], "weight": "2.4 ounces", "covers": [11800585], "physical_format": "Paperback", "subjects": ["Classics", "Detective and mystery stories, American", "Children's 9-12", "Horror tales, American", "Mystery and detective stories", "Children: Grades 2-3"], "languages": [{"key": "/languages/eng"}], "type": {"key": "/type/edition"}, "physical_dimensions": "7.2 x 4.2 x 0.5 inches", "ocaid": "famoustalesofmys00edga", "isbn_10": ["0893753696"], "isbn_13": ["9780893753696"], "edition_name